{
    // ------------------------------------------------------------------
    // QuestUITexts — generic English texts of the classic v75 quest, daily task and reward track windows,
    // copied verbatim from the official external_flash_texts (13 daily/quest keys + 54 generic reward_track.* keys).
    //
    // Delivery: this is a separate text resource, NOT part of UITexts. A hotel serves it next to its other
    // texts and lists it FIRST in "external.texts.url", so ExternalTexts / UITexts entries listed after it
    // override these defaults (later entries win). Every URL in that list must load, so only list it once
    // the file is deployed. Per-track and per-task content (reward_track.<track>.*, dailytask.<code>.*) is
    // hotel content served by the hotel, not part of this resource.
    // ------------------------------------------------------------------
